<title>POLAND: PPWK OCT NET FALLS TO PLN 0.3 MLN.</title>
<headline>PPWK OCT NET FALLS TO PLN 0.3 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-11-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results October</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>OCTOBER</p>
<p> Net profit	     0.26 vs   0.31</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 0.45 vs   0.39</p>
<p> Operating profit     0.48 vs   0.43</p>
<p> Sales		    1.74 vs   1.34</p>
<p>JANUARY-OCTOBER</p>
<p> Net profit	     4.27 vs   3.00</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 6.91 vs   5.10</p>
<p> Operating profit     7.40 vs   5.70</p>
<p> Sales		   22.18 vs  17.58</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish map maker is Polskie</p>
<p>Przedsiobiorstwo Wydawnictw Kartograficznych SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
